-19T08-03-45-01a0b98d-1310-7722-85ad-98bdd317bee4.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-19T12:41:05+00:00, thread_id=01a0b98d-1310-7722-85ad-98bdd317bee4, partial; all three delegated workers hit usage limits)\n\n### keywords\n\n- benchmark_judge.py, export-judge.ts, trajectory-passes.ts, model-adapters.ts, policy-judgement.ts, mastery.ts, learner-state.ts, runtime_or_model_changed, telemetry, injection tests\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user required “do it all end to end” and “Full replacement everywhere” -> continue through all planned judge sites; do not present the contract layer as sufficient completion [Task 1][Task 2]\n- when the user required a local judgement model “separate model configurable in settings” -> keep tutor-model and judgement-model settings independent [Task 1]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n- The shared cross-platform location is `packages/learner-contracts/src/judgement/`: `contracts.ts`, `projections.ts`, `router.ts`, `wire.ts`, `system-one.ts`, `local-backend.ts`, `assessment.ts`, `retrieval.ts`, and `boosting.ts`, exported through the package root. CLI, web, and mobile already consume `@keating/learner-contracts`. [Task 1]\n- Cascade routing starts at the cheapest tier, escalates only residue, skips uncalibrated tiers, never falls back from a pinned backend, and returns deterministic baseline plus abstention when exhausted. Thresholds key on backend/model/calibration/question digest. [Task 1]\n- Hosted System One is `POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone`; Choice is a criteria map, Score an ordered criteria array, and Noul has no confidence. Do not surface upstream bodies; same-origin gateway calls omit credentials. [Task 1]\n- `web/src/keating/judgement-model.ts` stores the independent `off|local|hosted` setting, defaults local to `RASMUS/MiniCPM5-2B-ONNX`, and accepts only same-origin gateway paths. Local Needle answers are typed/closed-vocabulary and omit unanswerable questions. [Task 1]\n- Assessment helpers keep readiness Nouls one-directional, use per-item performance Nouls, bucket duration/due dates, and mark uncertain open answers `grading: \"pending\"`. Retrieval uses calibrated z-scores, exact learner-message evidence, observed confidence <=0.65, and a 128-fact cap. Start boosting with a depth-limited tree and deterministic held-out rows. [Task 1]\n- The remaining plan targets include `scripts/training/benchmark_judge.py`, `web/src/keating/export-judge.ts`, `web/src/keating/trajectory-passes.ts`, `shared/evolution/model-adapters.ts`, `src/core/policy-judgement.ts`, `src/core/mastery.ts`, and `src/core/learner-state.ts`. Preserve server-side-only TypeSafe credentials, `NEEDLE_TELEMETRY=0`, `DO_NOT_TRACK=1`, evidence taxonomy, and no automatic irreversible action from judgement alone. [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Bun tests can pass while a type-only import is wrong because imports are stripped. After tests, always run `bun run typecheck`; assessment types belong in `contracts.ts`, not `projections.ts`. [Task 1]\n- Symptom: `ReferenceError: localStorage is not defined` in web setting tests -> use the existing inline storage/window/custom-event shim pattern in `web/src/test/learner-context.test.ts`. [Task 1]\n- The recorded `187 pass / 0 fail` package result and typecheck predate later boosting changes. Rerun the entire package suite before calling it green. For web: `cd web && bun run panda`, `bunx tsc --noEmit`, then `bun test`; also run root/Bun, benchmark, evidence-integrity, cache-key, offline/no-network, and injection checks. [Task 1][Task 2]\n- All three workers terminated with usage-limit errors and delivered no implementation result. Continue directly or use smaller bounded tasks; do not assume their files changed. [Task 2]\n\n# Task Group: /home/diogenes/Projects/textbook native terminal UI Canvas parity and Jev review\nscope: Continue native OpenTUI/Canvas parity and targeted UX refinement with modular TUI seams, verified local behavior, and an honest boundar