{"timestamp":"2026-09-20T06:50:31.377Z","ordinal":656,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0bd62-eabf-7a61-bb50-27a4047f7c4a","turn_id":"01a0bd69-84d5-7c33-89bf-e3198d5b775f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-b1351dcc-834e-44ab-9185-176bd5a4105c","process_id":"11110","command":["/bin/bash","-lc","rtk proxy awk 'NR>=29 && NR<=37 || NR>=129 && NR<=135 {print NR \":\" $0}' /home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md"],"cwd":"file:///home/diogenes/Projects/twyne","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rtk proxy awk 'NR>=29 && NR<=37 || NR>=129 && NR<=135 {print NR \":\" $0}' /home/diogenes/.codex/memories/MEMORY.md"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"29:\n30:## Reusable knowledge\n31:\n32:- The shared cross-platform location is `packages/learner-contracts/src/judgement/`: `contracts.ts`, `projections.ts`, `router.ts`, `wire.ts`, `system-one.ts`, `local-backend.ts`, `assessment.ts`, `retrieval.ts`, and `boosting.ts`, exported through the package root. CLI, web, and mobile already consume `@keating/learner-contracts`. [Task 1]\n33:- Cascade routing starts at the cheapest tier, escalates only residue, skips uncalibrated tiers, never falls back from a pinned backend, and returns deterministic baseline plus abstention when exhausted. Thresholds key on backend/model/calibration/question digest. [Task 1]\n34:- Hosted System One is `POST https://api.typesafe.ai/v1/systemone`; Choice is a criteria map, Score an ordered criteria array, and Noul has no confidence. Do not surface upstream bodies; same-origin gateway calls omit credentials. [Task 1]\n35:- `web/src/keating/judgement-model.ts` stores the independent `off|local|hosted` setting, defaults local to `RASMUS/MiniCPM5-2B-ONNX`, and accepts only same-origin gateway paths. Local Needle answers are typed/closed-vocabulary and omit unanswerable questions. [Task 1]\n36:- Assessment helpers keep readiness Nouls one-directional, use per-item performance Nouls, bucket duration/due dates, and mark uncertain open answers `grading: \"pending\"`. Retrieval uses calibrated z-scores, exact learner-message evidence, observed confidence <=0.65, and a 128-fact cap. Start boosting with a depth-limited tree and deterministic held-out rows. [Task 1]\n37:- The remaining plan targets include `scripts/training/benchmark_judge.py`, `web/src/keating/export-judge.ts`, `web/src/keating/trajectory-passes.ts`, `shared/evolution/model-adapters.ts`, `src/core/policy-judgement.ts`, `src/core/mastery.ts`, and `src/core/learner-state.ts`. Preserve server-side-only TypeSafe credentials, `NEEDLE_TELEMETRY=0`, `DO_NOT_TRACK=1`, evidence taxonomy, and no automatic irreversible action from judgement alone. [Task 2]\n129:## Reusable knowledge\n130:\n131:- Production Twyne calls Not Organic using DPoP and `judgement:evaluate` at `POST /v1/judgement`; direct `TYPESAFE_API_KEY` is only loopback/local fallback. The provider owns the key, typed state/questions transport, model alias resolution, and per-account reserve -> dispatch -> accept -> settle/reconcile accounting. [Task 1]\n132:- Jev question types are `noul`, `choice`, and `score`; normalize Twyne arrays into TypeSafe Choice maps, retain Score ordered arrays, bound requests, avoid upstream response bodies that may echo documents, and surface uncertain/missing usage rather than silently billing zero. The observed rate was `0.042` microUSD per input token. [Task 1]\n133:- `runRubricPass()` batches enabled criteria and degrades safely; `judgementRubricResult()` rejects incomplete criteria and protects saves with folio/brief/criteria/draft fingerprint freshness guards. Confidence is distribution concentration, not truth or permission to act. [Task 2]\n134:- The eight read-only lenses (`reader`, `revision`, `voice`, `promises`, `scraps`, `room`, `circling`, `research`) live in `src/utils/writing-lenses.ts`, with UI/storage at `src/components/writing-tools/writing-tools.tsx` and `src/utils/writing-tools-stor