ic verification without another scope-confirmation step; preserve unrelated `devenv.nix` and `devenv.lock` edits [Task 4]\n4396:- Older Twyne releases used `twyne@<version>`, while the current 0.17.0 checkout used `v<version>`; inspect `.github/workflows/release.yml` and current tags before each release instead of assuming a permanent tag prefix. The workflow publishes a non-draft GitHub Release plus source/Linux/macOS/Windows assets. [Task 1][Task 3]\n4397:- `bun run release:version` consumes bump fragments and updates `package.json`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and the lockfile, but may stop before creating a commit/tag. Proven sequence: run it; commit `Version Twyne`; tag that exact version commit; add a separate post-version two-line empty `.bumpy/*.md` marker commit; push `main`, then the tag. If the pre-push Bumpy check rejects the intentional version-before-marker topology, verify the topology then use `git push --no-verify` only for that tag. [Task 1][Task 3]\n4399:- Twyne 0.14.0 validated with `1091 pass`, `28 skip`, `0 fail`, production build/typecheck, tools check/22 tests, and lint with zero errors/five warnings. Version/tag target `7afcca8`, marker/main tip `7b52972`, and workflow `31564607735` led to source/Linux/macOS/Windows assets. [Task 1]\n4400:- Twyne 0.17.0 used version/tag target `49b0adb` and marker/main tip `ca826a6`; workflow `32764875049` passed, package version was `0.17.0`, and all four public release assets were confirmed. [Task 3]\n4402:- If frozen install fails with `GET https://registry.npmjs.org/@lix-js/plugin-json/-/plugin-json-0.1.8.tgz - 404`, the runtime imports are `src/utils/lix.ts` and `src/utils/collaboration.ts`. Vendor the exact tested runtime/declarations under `packages/lix-plugin-json`, preserve MIT license/metadata, switch to `file:packages/lix-plugin-json`, update `bun.lock`, and unignore only that package’s `dist`. Prove the archived tag target in a fresh directory with frozen install, `plugin_json` import, and production build b