{"timestamp":"2026-09-20T06:51:47.273Z","ordinal":691,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a0bd95-d0c9-7cc0-b533-e6ff2ba26d58","call_id":"call_enqxxzzaSG93jRDRvtSzqcxu","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 1.0 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 14147)\nTotal output lines: 7\n\n{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"86f51b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000005107,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":960,\"output\":\"name: Release\\n\\non:\\n  push:\\n    tags:\\n      - \\\"v*\\\"\\n      - \\\"twyne@*\\\"\\n  workflow_dispatch:\\n\\npermissions:\\n  contents: write\\n\\njobs:\\n  release:\\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\\n\\n    steps:\\n      - name: Checkout\\n        uses: actions/checkout@v5\\n\\n      - name: Setup Bun\\n        uses: oven-sh/setup-bun@v2\\n        with:\\n          bun-version: \\\"1.3.6\\\"\\n\\n      - name: Setup Node\\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v6\\n        with:\\n          node-version: \\\"24\\\"\\n\\n      - name: Install dependencies\\n        run: bun install --frozen-lockfile\\n\\n      - name: Build\\n        run: bun run build\\n\\n      - name: Package release bundle\\n        run: |\\n          version=\\\"${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-manual}\\\"\\n          version=\\\"${version#twyne@}\\\"\\n          mkdir -p release\\n          tar \\\\\\n            --exclude=\\\"./node_modules\\\" \\\\\\n            --exclude=\\\"./release\\\" \\\\\\n            --exclude=\\\"./.git\\\" \\\\\\n            -czf \\\"release/twyne-${version}.tar.gz\\\" .\\n\\n      - name: Publish GitHub release\\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\\n        with:\\n          files: release/*.tar.gz\\n          generate_release_notes: true\\n          draft: false\\n          prerelease: false\\n\\n  # Native desktop builds (Electrobun) — one runner per OS, each uploads its\\n  # app bundle to the same release the `release` job created. This is what the\\n  # landing page's \\\"Download Twyne for desktop\\\" link points at.\\n  desktop:\\n    needs: release\\n    name: Desktop (${{ matrix.label }})\\n    strategy:\\n      fail-fast: false\\n      matrix:\\n        include:\\n          - os: macos-latest\\n            label: macOS\\n            asset: twyne-desktop-macos\\n          - os: windows-latest\\n            label: Windows\\n            asset: twyne-desktop-windows\\n          - os: ubuntu-latest\\n            label: Linux\\n            asset: twyne-desktop-linux\\n    runs-on: ${{ matrix.os }}\\n\\n    steps:\\n      - name: Checkout\\n        uses: actions/checkout@v5\\n\\n      - name: Setup Bun\\n        uses: oven-sh/setup-bun@v2\\n        with:\\n          bun-version: \\\"1.3.6\\\"\\n\\n      - name: Setup Node\\n        uses: actions/setup-node@v6\\n        with:\\n          node-version: \\\"24\\\"\\n\\n      - name: Install dependencies\\n        run: bun install --frozen-lockfile\\n\\n      - name: Build desktop app\\n        run: bun run desktop.build\\n\\n      - name: Archive app bundle\\n        shell: bash\\n        run: |\\n          version=\\\"${GITHUB_REF_NAME:-manual}\\\"\\n          mkdir -p dist-desktop\\n          # electrobun emits the platform bundle under ./build (and any\\n          # installers under ./artifacts). Archive whatever is produced.\\n          tar -czf \\\"dist-desktop/${{ matrix.asset }}-${version}.tar.gz\\\" \\\\\\n            $( [ -d build ] && echo build ) \\\\\\n            $( [ -d artifacts ] && echo artifacts )\\n\\n      - name: Upload to release\\n        uses: softprops/action-gh-release@v2\\n        with:\\n          files: dist-desktop/*.tar.gz\\n          generate_release_notes: false\\n          draft: false\\n          prerelease: false\\n{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"https://railway.com/railway.schema.json\\\",\\n  \\\"build\\\": {\\n    \\\"builder\\\": \\\"RAILPACK\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"deploy\\\": {\\n    \\\"startCommand\\\": \\\"node server.js\\\",\\n    \\\"healthcheckPath\\\": \\\"/\\\",\\n    \\\"healthcheckTimeout\\\": 120,\\n    \\\"restartPolicyType\\\": \\\"ON_FAILURE\\\",\\n    \\\"restartPolicyMaxRetries\\\": 5\\n  }\\n}\\n#!/usr/bin/env bash\\n# Railway build step: deploy Convex backend (when key is configured), then\\n# build the Qwik City frontend + SSR server.\\n#\\n# Gating: when CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY is unset (frontend-only deploys, preview\\n# environments, local re-runs) we still build the frontend but skip the\\n# backend push.\\n\\nset -euo pipefail\\n\\nif [ -n \\\"${CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY:-}\\\" ]; then\\n  echo \\\"==> Deploying Convex backend\\\"\\n  npx convex deploy --cmd 'bun run build.client && bun run build.server'\\nelse\\n  echo \\\"==> CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY not set — building frontend only, skipping convex deploy\\\"\\n  bun run build.client\\n  bun run build.server\\nfi\\n\"}}\n{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"b7b8f6\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000024489,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":841,\"output\":\"{\\n  pkgs,\\n  lib,\\n  config,\\n  ...\\n}:\\n{\\n  # Per-project devenv config for the Twyne app shell.\\n  # Provides Bun + the orchestration tasks that previously lived in justfile.\\n\\n  # Keep the locked project modules compatible with the installed devenv CLI.\\n  devenv.cli.requireVersionMatch = lib.mkForce true;\\n\\n  dotenv.enable = true;\\n  languages.javascript = {\\n    enable = true;\\n    bun.enable = true;\\n  };\\n\\n  # Keep package.json as the command source of truth while exposing the common\\n  # project workflows through one namespaced devenv task graph.\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:install\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Install dependencies and run Convex codegen\\\";\\n    exec = ''\\n      bun install\\n      bun x convex dev --once --codegen enable --typecheck disable\\n    '';\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:codegen\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Regenerate Convex types\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun x convex dev --once --codegen enable --typecheck disable\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:check:types\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Typecheck the application\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run build.types\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:check:lint\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Lint the application\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run lint\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:check:format\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Check source formatting\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run fmt.check\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:check\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Run typecheck, lint, and format checks\\\";\\n    after = [\\n      \\\"twyne:check:types\\\"\\n      \\\"twyne:check:lint\\\"\\n      \\\"twyne:check:format\\\"\\n    ];\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:test\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Run the Bun test suite\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run test\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:build\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Build the production application\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run build\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:storybook:build\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Build the static Storybook\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run storybook.build\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:release:check\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Verify package version and release tag consistency\\\";\\n    exec = \\\"bun run release:check\\\";\\n  };\\n\\n  tasks.\\\"twyne:ci\\\" = {\\n    description = \\\"Run checks, tests, and production builds\\\";\\n    after = [\\n      \\\"twyne:check\\\"\\n      \\\"twyne:test\\\"\\n      \\\"twyne:build\\\"\\n      \\\"twyne:storybook:build\\\"\\n    ];\\n  };\\n\\n  git-hooks.hooks = {\\n    twyne-release-check = {\\n      enable = true;\\n      name = \\\"Twyne release consistency\\\";\\n      entry = \\\"devenv tasks run twyne:release:check\\\";\\n      language = \\\"system\\\";\\n      pass_filenames = false;\\n      always_run = true;\\n      # Bun creates the version commit before its annotated tag exists.\\n      # preversion/postversion guard that transition; only check pushes here.\\n      stages = [\\n        \\\"pre-push\\\"\\n      ];\\n    };\\n  };\\n\\n  # `devenv up` is the complete local workspace: Convex, the Qwik app, and\\n  # Storybook. Native process tasks remain individually controllable through\\n  # `devenv processes` and visible in `devenv tasks list`.\\n  process.manager.implementation = \\\"native\\\";\\n\\n  processes.\\\"server\\\".exec = \\\"bun run dev.backend\\\";\\n\\n  processes.\\\"app\\\" = {\\n    exec = \\\"bun run dev.frontend\\\";\\n    after = [ \\\"devenv:processes:server@started\\\" ];\\n    ready = {\\n      exec = \\\"${pkgs.curl}/bin/curl --fail --silent http://127.0.0.1:5173/ >/dev/null\\\";\\n      initial_delay = 1;\\n      period = 1;\\n      timeout = 60;\\n    };\\n  };\\n\\n  processes.\\\"storybook\\\" = {\\n    exec = \\\"bun run storybook\\\";\\n    ready = {\\n      http.get.port = 6006;\\n      initial_delay = 1;\\n      period = 1;\\n      timeout = 60;\\n    };\\n  };\\n}\\n\"}}\n{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"e6e1dc\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000010318,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":587,\"output\":\"# Changelog\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n## 0.18.0\\n<sub>2026-08-27</sub>\\n\\n-  *(minor)*\\n  Twyne 0.18 gives every writer a private, local-first desk for understanding\\n  their work, their editorial activity, and the cost of AI assistance.\\n\\n  **My Desk turns usage into a writing history.** A new responsive workspace\\n  brings together active days, current folios, editorial actions, recent work,\\n  deterministic writing patterns, and accessible charts. Signed-out writers keep\\n  the full experience on this device; signed-in writers can synchronize it across\\n  devices without making PostHog or manuscript content the source of truth.\\n\\n  **AI cost is legible without pretending estimates are bills.** The ledger\\n  separates actual hosted cost, versioned provider estimates, local inference,\\n  unknown cost, token dimensions, providers, models, features, and folios. Writers\\n  can inspect the methodology, export JSON or CSV, clear local history, and delete\\n  synchronized records.\\n\\n  **Public profiles remain private by default.** Writers can explicitly share a\\n  small set of writing statistics while tokens, cost, models, private folios, and\\n  usage patterns stay private. Version history, account deletion, authentication\\n  analytics, provider diagnostics, and application error recovery are also more\\n  dependable across the writing room.\\n\\n## 0.17.0\\n<sub>2026-08-24</sub>\\n\\n-  *(minor)*\\n  Twyne 0.17 files the dossier as a working paper beside the manuscript and makes\\n  the path from brief to desk easier to trust.\\n\\n  **The dossier now behaves like one document.** Creation and refinement share a\\n  two-leaf folio with a complete live preview, local-first Particulars, embedded\\n  draft review, and a clear filed acknowledgment before the editor opens. The\\n  latest filed copy replaces the previous dossier paper in the active folio's\\n  drawer.\\n\\n  **Writers can name the form without fighting a select box.** Essay remains the\\n  default, a broad filterable list covers familiar forms, and free text remains\\n  available for anything more specific.\\n\\n  **Public and collaborative state is more dependable.** The sitemap can include\\n  published Convex pages automatically, provider review failures fall back and\\n  report accurately, and comment resolution converges on the writer's requested\\n  state instead of toggling out of sync.\\n\\n## 0.16.0\\n<sub>2026-08-22</sub>\\n\"}}\n{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"f59a0d\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000018892,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":42,\"output\":\"7637604 v0.19.1\\n8f833d1 fix: use native Devenv release push hook\\n181cddc v0.19.0\\n803ff5b feat: move Twyne to Qwik 2\\n6c8cd0a chore: replace Bumpy with Bun versioning\\n\"}}\n{\"status\":\"fulfilled\",\"value\":{\"chunk_id\":\"e87c99\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.028911767,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":1292,\"output\":\"1527:- v0.19.1, bun run release:version patch, check-release-version.ts, git-hooks.nix, prek install -f, Dagger, SOURCE_IGNORE\\n1535:- The native release consistency hook belongs at `pre-push`, not `pre-commit`, because Bun makes the version commit before the annotated tag. `release:version` uses `bun pm version`; `release:check` enforces SemVer, annotated `v<version>`, manifest equality, and no unexpected tag at HEAD. [Task 1]\\n1540:- Do not call Vet passed when safety blocks network export. GitHub’s `ReferenceError: SOURCE_IGNORE is not defined` was an independent pre-existing Dagger failure; Windows packaging was still running at last check. [Task 1]\\n1636:- release:version, release:check, release:preflight, STICH_RELEASE_CHANNEL, v0.1.1, v0.1.2, railpack.json, signing-secrets\\n1668:- Release checker requires coordinated SemVer across root, `apps/{agent,desktop,mcp,mobile,web}/package.json`, and `apps/mobile/app.json`, plus annotated `v<version>` tag and no unexpected version tag at `HEAD`. `bun run release:version`, `bun run release:check`, and `release:publish` (`git push --follow-tags`) are the defined sequence. [Task 1]\\n2321:- Twyne now uses `release:version: bun pm version`, `release:publish: git push --follow-tags`, and `release:check: bun scripts/check-release-version.ts`. `preversion`, `postversion`, and `.githooks/pre-push.pre-entire` all call the shared guard. [Task 1]\\n3105:- twyne.love, sitemap.xml, robots.txt, trailing-slash, canonical, SSR, real 404, Railway, Bumpy, railway-build.sh, 1ab18277-325a-4619-ba61-bde7aa2a0a88, SOURCE_IGNORE\\n3140:- Historical 0.17.0 topology was feature commit -> `bun run release:version` -> `Version Twyne` -> tag exact version commit -> separate empty `.bumpy/release-<version>.md` marker -> push main/tag. `v0.17.0` targets `49b0adb`, marker/main tip is `ca826a6`, and workflow `32764875049` assets p